  <p>
    The Site may link to third-party websites or reference third-party platforms. We aren’t responsible for their content, policies
    or availability.
  </p>

  <h2>No guarantee of results</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to deliver great outcomes, but search rankings, advertising performance, traffic and sales depend on many factors
    outside our control (including search engines, ad platforms and market conditions). We therefore can’t guarantee specific
    results.
  </p>

  <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    The Site is provided “as is” and “as available”, without warranties of any kind, express or implied, to the fullest extent
    permitted by law.
  </p>

